---
const original = "https://cdn.hob.farm/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,quality=84,width=1200/articles/vaporwave/caesars-palace-pool-statue.jpg";
const transformed = "https://cdn.hob.farm/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,quality=84,width=1000/articles/vaporwave/caesars-palace-pool-statue-vaporwave.png";
const video = "https://cdn.hob.farm/articles/vaporwave/caesars-palace-pool-statue-vaporwave.mp4";
---

<figure class="vaporwave-transform vaporwave-article-media article-wide not-prose">
  <div class="vaporwave-transform__pair">
    <div>
      <span>Photograph</span>
      <img
        src={original}
        alt="A monumental classical statue and repeated arches beside the Caesars Palace pool under a blue Las Vegas sky"
        width="4032"
        height="3024"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div>
      <span>Reconstruction</span>
      <img
        src={transformed}
        alt="The same Caesars Palace statue and arches rebuilt as a violet and cyan vaporwave cityscape"
        width="1086"
        height="1448"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster={transformed} aria-label="Five-second vaporwave transformation of the Caesars Palace photograph">
    <source src={video} type="video/mp4" />
    <a href={video}>Open the transformation video</a>
  </video>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>The architecture survives the edit.</strong>
    <span>The source photograph and the author-directed transformation use the same statue, arches, tower, palms, and desert sky. The color and implied technology change; the temporal collision was already there.</span>
    <small>Original photograph and transformation direction by the author; generated with ChatGPT and additional AI tools.</small>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .vaporwave-transform {
    margin-block: 2.7rem !important;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 94 203 / 0.38);
    background: #080611;
    box-shadow: 0.65rem 0.72rem 0 rgb(4 2 10 / 0.3);
  }

  .vaporwave-transform__pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .vaporwave-transform__pair > div {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    background: #05040a;
  }

  .vaporwave-transform__pair > div + div {
    border-left: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.25);
  }

  .vaporwave-transform__pair span {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    top: 0.65rem;
    left: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.45rem;
    color: #fff;
    background: rgb(8 6 17 / 0.82);
    font: 750 0.61rem/1 var(--font-mono), monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .vaporwave-transform__pair > div:last-child img {
    object-position: center 42%;
  }

  video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 38rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.25);
    background: #020105;
  }

  figcaption {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem 1rem;
    border-top: 4px solid #55eadb;
    color: #d9d3df;
    text-align: left !important;
  }

  figcaption strong {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  figcaption span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  figcaption small {
    color: #9d93aa;
    font: 650 0.64rem/1.45 var(--font-mono), monospace;
  }

  @media (max-width: 35rem) {
    .vaporwave-transform__pair {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .vaporwave-transform__pair > div + div {
      border-top: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.25);
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
